DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
2915::$$$message_0019_0000_0000$$$::It's about three o'clock, so I'll make some tea.[lr]::
2916::$$$message_0019_0000_0001$$$::I'll make some for me, and...Sakura and Saber. I'll see if anyone else wants some.::
2917::$$$message_0019_0001_0000$$$::"Oh."[lr]::
2918::$$$message_0019_0001_0001$$$::Good, someone's in the living room.[lr]::
2919::$$$message_0019_0001_0002$$$::It's so dreary killing time by myself. I'll ask whoever's there to join me if they have time.::
2920::$$$message_0019_0002_0000$$$::"Oh, it's you, Illya."[lr]::
2921::$$$message_0019_0002_0001$$$::"Hello. I made myself at home, Shirou."[lr]::
2922::$$$message_0019_0002_0002$$$::"Let me know if you're coming. I would've opened the door for you... Well, it's fine. Good timing, either way."::
2923::$$$message_0019_0003_0000$$$::"Hm? What do you mean?"[lr]::
2924::$$$message_0019_0003_0001$$$::"Nah, I was just about to make tea. Sorry I couldn't give you a proper welcome."[lr]::
2925::$$$message_0019_0003_0002$$$::What should I do... Illya doesn't like bitter or spicy things, so I'll play it safe and use the black tea.::
2926::$$$message_0019_0004_0000$$$::"It's okay, Shirou. Sit there."[lr]::
2927::$$$message_0019_0004_0001$$$::"...?"[lr]::
2928::$$$message_0019_0004_0002$$$::For now, I do as I'm told and sit.::
2929::$$$message_0019_0005_0000$$$::"Come on, Shirou. You're the head of the house, so you need to have more presence of mind than that."[lr]::
2930::$$$message_0019_0005_0001$$$::"...Mgh. Well, yeah."[lr]::
2931::$$$message_0019_0005_0002$$$::Her opinion is perfectly valid, but it would also be rude as the head of household for me to not greet a guest at the door.[lr]::
2932::$$$message_0019_0005_0003$$$::To be honest, I don't think I'll ever be able to make myself act all high and mighty.::
2933::$$$message_0019_0006_0000$$$::"Big Brother, you said you were about to make tea, right?"[lr]::
2934::$$$message_0019_0006_0001$$$::"Y-yeah. I can't relax unless I have tea. Oh, do you not like rice crackers?"[lr]::
2935::$$$message_0019_0006_0002$$$::...Wait. Hold on.[lr]::
2936::$$$message_0019_0006_0003$$$::I just realized something.::
2937::$$$message_0019_0007_0000$$$::Someone's in the kitchen.::
2938::$$$message_0019_0008_0000$$$::"If it's tea you want... Leys."[lr]::
2939::$$$message_0019_0008_0001$$$::"Yeah, Illya?"::
2940::$$$message_0019_0009_0000$$$::[large]WHOA![rf][lr]::
2941::$$$message_0019_0009_0001$$$::There she is! [shock vmax=30 time=400 count=-3]A ghost[line len=2]I mean, one of Illya's maids! In my house!::
2942::$$$message_0019_0010_0000$$$::"Make Darjeeling tea for Shirou, and I'll have hot chocolate."[lr]::
2943::$$$message_0019_0010_0001$$$::"Mm, got it."::
2944::$$$message_0019_0011_0000$$$::The white-clad maid quietly disappears back into the kitchen.[lr]::
2945::$$$message_0019_0011_0001$$$::...I have no words.[lr]::
2946::$$$message_0019_0011_0002$$$::Of course I don't. [chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ01a(中) textoff=0]Anyone would be surprised to see a maid suddenly come out of his own kitchen.::
2947::$$$message_0019_0012_0000$$$::"...Shirou, why do you look so surprised?"[lr]::
2948::$$$message_0019_0012_0001$$$::"W-w-why wouldn't I be!? What are your maids doing in my house!?"[lr]::
2949::$$$message_0019_0012_0002$$$::"Well, it's improper for a lady to go out without her attendants, is it not?"[lr]::
2950::$$$message_0019_0012_0003$$$::Illya chuckles lightly.[lr]::
2951::$$$message_0019_0012_0004$$$::...It's bad manners not to have her entourage with her? What year is it?::
2952::$$$message_0019_0013_0000$$$::"...Hold on. I thought you [font italic=true]didn't[font italic=false] like having your maids with you."[lr]::
2953::$$$message_0019_0013_0001$$$::"Not when I'm out having fun.[lr]::
2954::$$$message_0019_0013_0002$$$::But don't you agree they're convenient at times like this?"[lr]::
2955::$$$message_0019_0013_0003$$$::"Haaah...[cacheimage storage=イリヤ05a(中)][wvl][dash textoff=0 hidefg=0 mx=367 opacity=200 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=400 imag=1 time=1200 cy=300 mag=1.4 my=-1 storage=i衛宮邸居間(fd) rot=-0.0 accel=-2][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 time=1200 pos=l accel=-2 storage=イリヤ05a(中)] Still, but this is..."::
2956::$$$message_0019_0014_0000$$$::I peer in to the kitchen...and see that they really are attending to various chores.[lr]::
2957::$$$message_0019_0014_0001$$$::I get a little dizzy, feeling like I'm staring into another dimension. Those maid uniforms look too high-class for my house, making them look like [font italic=true]they're[font italic=false] the masters.[sestop time=1000 nowait=true]::
2958::$$$message_0019_0015_0000$$$::"What? Hmm, Shirou, don't tell me..."[lr]::
2959::$$$message_0019_0015_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
2960::$$$message_0019_0015_0002$$$::"Are you upset because the kitchen is your territory and someone else is in it?"[lr]::
2961::$$$message_0019_0015_0003$$$::"Huh...?"::
2962::$$$message_0019_0016_0000$$$::...It [font italic=true]is[font italic=false] making me uncomfortable, now that she mentions it.[lr]::
2963::$$$message_0019_0016_0001$$$::Everyone uses the kitchen, so it's not as if I mean to hog it to myself, but...::
2964::$$$message_0019_0017_0000$$$::"Aha. Sella and Leys are strangers to you, so you're afraid of them infringing on your territory.[lr]::
2965::$$$message_0019_0017_0001$$$::You probably don't mind Sakura and the others because they're like family to you."[lr]::
2966::$$$message_0019_0017_0002$$$::"...Makes sense. You might be right about that. I don't think I'd mind you being in there, though."[lr]::
2967::$$$message_0019_0017_0003$$$::If Illya was in the kitchen...she wouldn't be tall enough to use the counter.[lr]::
2968::$$$message_0019_0017_0004$$$::While I picture that image, a white figure emerges from the kitchen.::
2969::$$$message_0019_0018_0000$$$::"Tea is ready, Mistress."[wvs][sestop time=300 nowait=true][lr]::
2970::$$$message_0019_0018_0001$$$::"Here you go, Illya. [cacheimage storage=リズ01a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=リズ01a(中) textoff=0]Careful. It's hot."[lr]::
2971::$$$message_0019_0018_0002$$$::The maid who speaks awkwardly, Leysritt, sets a cup in front of Illya.[lr]::
2972::$$$message_0019_0018_0003$$$::But...there are no expensive cups and saucers like this in this house.::
2973::$$$message_0019_0019_0000$$$::Meanwhile...[lr]::
2974::$$$message_0019_0019_0001$$$::"...Master Emiya."[lr]::
2975::$$$message_0019_0019_0002$$$::"Y-[wvl][shock vmax=20 time=200 count=-2]yeah...?"[lr]::
2976::$$$message_0019_0019_0003$$$::The governess-like Sella, perhaps my greatest foe in the Einzbern Castle, approaches me.::
2977::$$$message_0019_0020_0000$$$::"Master Emiya, this is the highest grade of early autumnal Darjeeling tea, sourced from our house's friendship with the Thurbo Estate."[lr]::
2978::$$$message_0019_0020_0001$$$::"Early...autum-what?"[lr]::
2979::$$$message_0019_0020_0002$$$::Argh... I'm not sure how well I'd react to Japanese tea, but she must be attacking me because she knows I'm not familiar with black teas...!::
2980::$$$message_0019_0021_0000$$$::"This is a special varietal that is normally served only to our patriarch, friends of the house, or guests with whom we have a long association.[lr]::
2981::$$$message_0019_0021_0001$$$::Therefore, Master Shirou Emiya..."[lr]::
2982::$$$message_0019_0021_0002$$$::"Wh-[wvl][shock vmax=20 time=200 count=-2]what? It's just some expensive tea, right?"::
2983::$$$message_0019_0022_0000$$$::"What a basic statement. It is not a question of its [font italic=true]price[font italic=false].[lr]::
2984::$$$message_0019_0022_0001$$$::I should not need to say this, but this tea is a sign of my mistress's favor.[lr]::
2985::$$$message_0019_0022_0002$$$::Do you understand, Master Shirou Emiya?[lr]::
2986::$$$message_0019_0022_0003$$$::You must taste my mistress's feelings with care, and never betray her faith in you."[lr]::
2987::$$$message_0019_0022_0004$$$::"..."[lr]::
2988::$$$message_0019_0022_0005$$$::She says it with a vigor that clearly isn't asking for my consent.[lr]::
2989::$$$message_0019_0022_0006$$$::I can't believe I'm getting a lecture before I even get my tea.::
2990::$$$message_0019_0023_0000$$$::Illya's grinning.[lr]::
2991::$$$message_0019_0023_0001$$$::Is it that funny to watch me get lectured? ...I guess it must be.::
2992::$$$message_0019_0024_0000$$$::"Haaah... Thank you for the tea."[lr]::
2993::$$$message_0019_0024_0001$$$::I'm being made to feel ashamed for having tea in my own house.[lr]::
2994::$$$message_0019_0024_0002$$$::...Even I can tell how excellent this tea is.[lr]::
2995::$$$message_0019_0024_0003$$$::It has an incredibly refined aroma, and tastes sweet and smooth without needing to add anything to it.::
2996::$$$message_0019_0025_0000$$$::"...Oh yeah, Shirou?[lr]::
2997::$$$message_0019_0025_0001$$$::I brought this today because I wanted to, but don't worry about it, okay? It's not like I'm asking you to have tea on hand that's this fancy."[lr]::
2998::$$$message_0019_0025_0002$$$::"...I appreciate you saying that. And sorry for always serving you cheap tea."::
2999::$$$message_0019_0026_0000$$$::I feel ashamed of serving Illya cheap genmaicha [chgfg time=300 storage=リズ01a(中) textoff=0]when she normally gets to drink stuff like this at home.[lr]::
3000::$$$message_0019_0026_0001$$$::On top of that...[chgfg time=100 storage=リズ01b(中) textoff=0][chgfg time=300 storage=リズ01a(中) textoff=0][wait canskip=0 time=300]being flanked by Sella and Leys is incredibly unsettling.::
3001::$$$message_0019_0027_0000$$$::"Shirou, I bet you want dessert, don't you?"[lr]::
3002::$$$message_0019_0027_0001$$$::"Uh...sure... Did you bring that, too?"[lr]::
3003::$$$message_0019_0027_0002$$$::"Of course. Sella, Leys."::
3004::$$$message_0019_0028_0000$$$::The maids break into motion again.[lr]::
3005::$$$message_0019_0028_0001$$$::I breathe a sigh of relief once they disappear into the kitchen.::
3006::$$$message_0019_0029_0000$$$::"Ahaha, you're so nervous, Shirou."[lr]::
3007::$$$message_0019_0029_0001$$$::"...Of course I am. I've never had maids waiting on me while I have tea... Ahh."[lr]::
3008::$$$message_0019_0029_0002$$$::I think I'm starting to see why Illya often goes out on her own.[lr]::
3009::$$$message_0019_0029_0003$$$::While she's used to having the maids around, there are probably times when she feels freedom when they're not there.::
3010::$$$message_0019_0030_0000$$$::"Haah... You've got it rough, too."[lr]::
3011::$$$message_0019_0030_0001$$$::"Just a little. But Sella doesn't nag as much as she used to. She's still pretty busy trying to keep up appearances, though."::
3012::$$$message_0019_0031_0000$$$::"...Sella's diligent. She just wants you to grow up into a proper lady."[lr]::
3013::$$$message_0019_0031_0001$$$::"...Yeah.[lr]::
3014::$$$message_0019_0031_0002$$$::I'd better grow up big and strong, like she hopes."::
3015::$$$message_0019_0032_0000$$$::"Do you want more, Illya?"[lr]::
3016::$$$message_0019_0032_0001$$$::"No, this is enough. Give my big brother more, Leys."[lr]::
3017::$$$message_0019_0032_0002$$$::"Mistress, you should not address him like that[line len=2][cacheimage storage=セラ01a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セラ01a(中) textoff=0]Master Shirou Emiya, this is the Triple Berry Pie from La Fleur."::
3018::$$$message_0019_0033_0000$$$::Oof.[lr]::
3019::$$$message_0019_0033_0001$$$::A pie is suddenly set down in front of me, topped with cream and a variety of berries.[lr]::
3020::$$$message_0019_0033_0002$$$::This must be the [chgfg time=300 storage=リズ01a(中) textoff=0]Very Very Berry that Tohsaka mentioned... It sure is red.[lr]::
3021::$$$message_0019_0033_0003$$$::Illya excitedly pokes her fork into it. She must not mind all the red.::
3022::$$$message_0019_0034_0000$$$::"This is another one of my mistress's preferred pastries.[lr]::
3023::$$$message_0019_0034_0001$$$::I do hope you won't waste a single crumb, Master Emiya."[lr]::
3024::$$$message_0019_0034_0002$$$::"R-right...I think I get it now, Sella."[lr]::
3025::$$$message_0019_0034_0003$$$::"What do you mean?"::
3026::$$$message_0019_0035_0000$$$::"Well, this isn't the castle, so can't you relax a little?[lr]::
3027::$$$message_0019_0035_0001$$$::To me, you look so tense that I can practically hear how stiff and creaky your shoulders are."[lr]::
3028::$$$message_0019_0035_0002$$$::"Ngh..."::
3029::$$$message_0019_0036_0000$$$::"Oh, he's right... Sella, are you sensitive to the cold?"[lr]::
3030::$$$message_0019_0036_0001$$$::"Leysritt...!"[lr]::
3031::$$$message_0019_0036_0002$$$::"Ahaha. Yeah, maybe you could use a trip to a healing hot spring."::
3032::$$$message_0019_0037_0000$$$::"Mistress... [cacheimage storage=イリヤ01a(中),セラ01a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=イリヤ01a(中),セラ01a(中) textoff=0]While I am grateful for your concern, I am your lady-in-waiting. I must implore you to care more about your own well-being."[lr]::
3033::$$$message_0019_0037_0001$$$::Our teasing fails to budge her iron will.[lr]::
3034::$$$message_0019_0037_0002$$$::She really is the perfect maid.::
3035::$$$message_0019_0038_0000$$$::"...Ahem.[lr]::
3036::$$$message_0019_0038_0001$$$::Master Emiya. To answer your earlier question, my shoulders are not stiff. Your concern is unwarranted."[lr]::
3037::$$$message_0019_0038_0002$$$::"O-oh... Then I'll gratefully eat this.::
3038::$$$message_0019_0039_0000$$$::I move my fork to the mountain of berries and cream... [chgfg time=100 storage=リズ01b(中) textoff=0]But being stared at from both sides [chgfg time=100 storage=リズ01a(中) textoff=0]is unnerving.[lr]::
3039::$$$message_0019_0039_0001$$$::At this point, we may as well...::
3040::$$$message_0019_0040_0000$$$::"Hey. Are you two not going to have any?"[lr]::
3041::$$$message_0019_0040_0001$$$::"Correct. Servants do not dine with the mistress."[lr]::
3042::$$$message_0019_0040_0002$$$::"Nein danke."::
3043::$$$message_0019_0041_0000$$$::"Oh..."[lr]::
3044::$$$message_0019_0041_0001$$$::That was a bust.[lr]::
3045::$$$message_0019_0041_0002$$$::...Illya looks like she's been genuinely enjoying this exchange.[lr]::
3046::$$$message_0019_0041_0003$$$::She must be getting a kick out of seeing me so bewildered.[lr]::
3047::$$$message_0019_0041_0004$$$::"..."[lr]::
3048::$$$message_0019_0041_0005$$$::But it feels even harder to move my fork now...::
3049::$$$message_0019_0042_0000$$$::"Hm? Is this bothering you, Shirou?"[lr]::
3050::$$$message_0019_0042_0001$$$::"...Well, yeah. I feel like a prisoner in my own home."[lr]::
3051::$$$message_0019_0042_0002$$$::"That would be a waste of the delicious tea and cake. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ01c(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=イリヤ01c(中) time=400 textoff=0]Sella, Leys. You're dismissed until I summon you again."::
3052::$$$message_0019_0043_0000$$$::"Okay, Illya."[lr]::
3053::$$$message_0019_0043_0001$$$::"We will stand by over there, Mistress."::
3054::$$$message_0019_0044_0000$$$::The living room suddenly feels bigger as soon as the white-clad maids are gone.[lr]::
3055::$$$message_0019_0044_0001$$$::I heave a long, relieved sigh from the bottom of my lungs.::
3056::$$$message_0019_0045_0000$$$::"Hehe. I can tease you using those two.[lr]::
3057::$$$message_0019_0045_0001$$$::I guess I'll bring them along next time! [humming]"[lr]::
3058::$$$message_0019_0045_0002$$$::"Gimme a break... I wouldn't even be able to taste my dinner with them around."::
3059::$$$message_0019_0046_0000$$$::"Really? ...That makes me worry about your future, Shirou.[lr]::
3060::$$$message_0019_0046_0001$$$::If you act like this now, how are you going to be a good escort once you have a girl you love?"[lr]::
3061::$$$message_0019_0046_0002$$$::"I-I know how to be an escort...![lr]::
3062::$$$message_0019_0046_0003$$$::What I'm trying to say is, like, your maids are way too fancy and out of place.[cacheimage storage=イリヤ07a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ07a(中)] And the only time I'd be playing escort is for small stuff like when we go shopping, and[line len=2]"::
3063::$$$message_0019_0047_0000$$$::"Are you sure about that?[lr]::
3064::$$$message_0019_0047_0001$$$::My prediction is that in the future, you're going to go on an incredibly extravagant, elegant date.[lr]::
3065::$$$message_0019_0047_0002$$$::You need to know that this is one function that you won't be able to get out of, no matter how bad you think you are at socializing."[lr]::
3066::$$$message_0019_0047_0003$$$::"Function...? You mean this...extravagant date with a girl I love?"::
3067::$$$message_0019_0048_0000$$$::"Yeah. Don't believe me?"[lr]::
3068::$$$message_0019_0048_0001$$$::Uh... Well, it's not that I don't trust her, but to begin with...[lr]::
3069::$$$message_0019_0048_0002$$$::"...More than the place, I can't even imagine I'll have anyone to go with. What am I supposed to do then...?"::
3070::$$$message_0019_0049_0000$$$::"You'll be okay.[lr]::
3071::$$$message_0019_0049_0001$$$::If there's no one else to go with you, then I will.[lr]::
3072::$$$message_0019_0049_0002$$$::Actually...I get to have the first date with you. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ03b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ03b(中)]You're going to come for me, like a prince in shining armor."::
3073::$$$message_0019_0050_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
3074::$$$message_0019_0050_0001$$$::...Crap.[wait canskip=0 time=500] I suddenly feel dizzy, like my brain is melting.[lr]::
3075::$$$message_0019_0050_0002$$$::Her smile is the sweetest sight in the world. The berry pie is tasteless next to it.::
3076::$$$message_0019_0051_0000$$$::"Ah... Um, Illya..."[lr]::
3077::$$$message_0019_0051_0001$$$::"Come on, Big Brother, your fork stopped moving. You're about to get jam on your mouth, like a little brother with bad manners.[lr]::
3078::$$$message_0019_0051_0002$$$::...Hehe. Honestly, if you're too sloppy, I'll eat everything right up."::
3079::$$$message_0019_0052_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
3080::$$$message_0019_0052_0001$$$::I'm at the mercy of her voice. It's alluring, like that of an older woman.[lr]::
3081::$$$message_0019_0052_0002$$$::I chew absently on the pie. I'm not sure what it tastes like anymore.::
3082::$$$message_0019_0053_0000$$$::I must be as soft as Illya says...[lr]::
3083::$$$message_0019_0053_0001$$$::My head feels dizzy from indescribable emotions that aren't quite tension nor confusion.[lr]::
3084::$$$message_0019_0053_0002$$$::Sella and Leys were just the starters. Even when Illya is alone[line len=2]no, especially when she's alone, Illya is a saccharine lady who's sweeter than any cake.::
902980::$$$message_9019_0021_0000$$$::"This is a special varietal that is normally served only to our patriarch, friends of the house, or guests with whom we have a long association."[r]::c+